### initialize
# What most MCP clients send today. Mcp.Remote.Tests covers the other protocol versions.
POST /docs/_mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-11-25",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "journey-test", "version": "1.0.0" }
  }
}

### tools/list
POST /docs/_mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list" }
